{"id": "12-293-2-8", "zh": "77. gacchanta（行走者），加词尾 si。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-294-2-15", "zh": "依“在 si 之前，gacchanta 等词的 nta 音变为 aṃ”一条，nta 音可任意变为 aṃ，并删去 si。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-294-16-22", "zh": "得 gacchaṃ；或者 si 变为 o，得 gacchanto。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-295-2-4", "zh": "“gacchanta 等词的 nta 音”这一项沿用到下一条。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-296-2-3", "zh": "在其余情况下，如同 ntu。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-297-2-10", "zh": "除了上面说过的情况，在其余情况下，gacchanta 等词的 nta 音应当看作与 ntu 相同。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-297-11-14", "zh": "例如 gacchanto、gacchantā 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-298-2-4", "zh": "其余变化与 guṇavantu 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-299-2-9", "zh": "78. 所谓 gacchanta 等词，是指以 anta 词缀结尾的词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-300-2-8", "zh": "79. aggi（火），删去 si。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-301-2-12", "zh": "依“i 类元音与 u 类元音称为 jha 与 la”一条，i 类元音与 u 类元音依次得名 jha 与 la。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-302-2-4", "zh": "“在 jha、la 之后”与“任意”两项沿用到下一条。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-303-2-6", "zh": "在 gha、pa 之后，yo 也要删除。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-304-2-7", "zh": "在 gha、pa、jha、la 之后，yo 可以任意删除。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-305-2-5", "zh": "在已变为 ni 或已删除的 yo 之前，变为长音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-306-2-12", "zh": "凡是已经变为 ni 或已经删除的 yo，在这些 yo 之前，元音变为长音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-306-13-14", "zh": "得 aggī。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-306-15-16", "zh": "另一种情况下，“变为 a”这一项沿用到下一条。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "12-307-2-5", "zh": "在 yo 之前，未变短的 jha 也变为 a。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "12-308-2-7", "zh": "在 yo 之前，未经变短的 jha 变为 a。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-308-8-9", "zh": "得 aggayo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-308-10-11", "zh": "呼格也是这样。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-309-2-9", "zh": "80. 在 jha、la、pa 之后，aṃ 与 mo 变为鼻音（niggahīta）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "12-310-2-8", "zh": "在 jha、la、pa 之后，aṃ 与 mo 都变为鼻音点。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "12-310-9-10", "zh": "得 aggiṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-310-11-14", "zh": "aggī、aggayo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-311-2-6", "zh": "81. agginā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-311-7-10", "zh": "变为长音后，得 aggībhi、aggīhi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-312-2-17", "zh": "82. 依“在 jha、la 之后，sa 任意变为 no”一条，sa 可任意变为 no。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-312-18-21", "zh": "得 aggino、aggissa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-312-22-23", "zh": "aggīnaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-313-2-14", "zh": "83. 依“在 jha、la 之后也是如此”一条，smā 变为 nā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-313-15-16", "zh": "得 agginā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-314-2-8", "zh": "84. aggimhi、aggismiṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-314-9-10", "zh": "aggīsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-315-2-7", "zh": "85. ādi（开端）的变化如同 aggi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-315-8-23", "zh": "至于 smiṃ，则依“在 ādi 之后也变为 o”一条，可任意变为 aṃ 与 o。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "12-315-24-31", "zh": "ādi、ādo、ādimhi、ādismiṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-315-32-33", "zh": "ādīsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-316-2-9", "zh": "86. daṇḍī（持杖者），加词尾 si。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-317-2-22", "zh": "依“非 gha 者变短”等条，本应变为短音；但依“在 si 之前，非中性词不变短”一条，在 si 之前，非中性词不变为短音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-317-23-30", "zh": "删去 si，得 daṇḍī；删去 yo 时，也得 daṇḍī。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-317-31-32", "zh": "另一种情况下——", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-318-2-5", "zh": "非 gha 者，在单数词尾与 yo 之前也变为短音。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "12-319-2-6", "zh": "在单数词尾与 yo 之前，jha、la、pa 变为短音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-320-2-4", "zh": "“在已变短的 jha 之后”这一项沿用到下一条。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-321-2-4", "zh": "yo 变为 no。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-322-2-7", "zh": "在已变短的 jha 之后，yo 变为 no。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-322-8-9", "zh": "得 daṇḍino。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-323-2-16", "zh": "87. 依“jha、la、pa 变短”一条，后面接 ga（呼格词尾）时，jha、la、pa 变为短音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-323-17-18", "zh": "得 he daṇḍi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-323-19-22", "zh": "daṇḍī、daṇḍino。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-324-2-8", "zh": "88. “任意”与“aṃ”两项沿用到下一条。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "12-325-2-13", "zh": "依“在已变短的 jha 之后变为 naṃ”一条，aṃ 可任意变为 naṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-325-14-17", "zh": "得 daṇḍinaṃ、daṇḍiṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-325-18-21", "zh": "daṇḍī、daṇḍino。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-326-2-6", "zh": "89. daṇḍinā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-326-7-10", "zh": "daṇḍībhi、daṇḍīhi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-327-2-8", "zh": "90. daṇḍino、daṇḍissa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-327-9-10", "zh": "daṇḍīnaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-328-2-7", "zh": "91. “在已变短的 jha 之后”这一项沿用到下一条。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-329-2-10", "zh": "依“smiṃ 变为 ni”一条，smiṃ 变为 ni。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-329-11-12", "zh": "得 daṇḍini。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-329-13-14", "zh": "daṇḍīsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-330-2-8", "zh": "92. bhikkhu（比丘），删去 si。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-331-2-4", "zh": "“任意”与“yo”两项沿用到下一条。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "12-332-2-15", "zh": "依“在 la 之后也变为 vo”一条，在 la 之后，yo 可任意变为 vo。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-333-2-4", "zh": "“变为 a”与“未变短的”两项沿用到下一条。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "12-334-2-5", "zh": "在 ve、vo 之前，la 也变为 a。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-335-2-7", "zh": "在 ve、vo 之前，未经变短的 la 变为 a。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-335-8-14", "zh": "得 bhikkhavo；另一种情况下，删去 yo 并变为长音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-335-15-16", "zh": "得 bhikkhū。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-336-2-6", "zh": "93. he bhikkhu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-337-2-16", "zh": "依“在未变短的 la 之后，呼格的 yo 变为 ve、vo”一条，呼格的 yo 变为 ve 与 vo，la 变为 a。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-337-17-22", "zh": "bhikkhave、bhikkhavo、bhikkhū。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-338-2-6", "zh": "94. bhikkhuṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-338-7-10", "zh": "bhikkhavo、bhikkhū。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-338-11-13", "zh": "其余变化如同 aggi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-339-2-7", "zh": "95. jantu（众生）也照这样变化。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-339-8-11", "zh": "jantū、jantavo。", "confidence": 85}
